# Moves the group's tool center point (TCP) to a pose, rest to rest.

# frame_id empty or the group's base frame: the TCP pose in the base frame.
# frame_id the group's tool frame: a move relative to the TCP where the motion starts.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target
# The TCP along a straight line instead of a joint-space motion.
bool linear
# Fraction of the robot's motion limits in (0, 1]; 0 means 1.
float64 speed
---
# Measured joint positions when the motion finished, in the group's joint order.
float64[] positions
---
